✅ wasm_run_flutter macOS pod stays linkable without a vendored framework macOS pod compiles no sources referencing wasm_run FFI symbols
✅ wasm_run_flutter macOS pod stays linkable without a vendored framework Podfile still force_loads + exports the static archive
::endgroup::

